@ArquiteturaBaseApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5159

### Health Check
GET {{ArquiteturaBaseApi_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Hello World - Público
GET {{ArquiteturaBaseApi_HostAddress}}/api/HelloWorld/publico
Accept: application/json

### Autenticação - Login
# @name login
POST {{ArquiteturaBaseApi_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Hello World - Privado (Requer JWT)
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

GET {{ArquiteturaBaseApi_HostAddress}}/api/HelloWorld/privado
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json
